{"2908130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Distant Isles", "steam_appid": 2908130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras/a937897f49cf64d29b36fb728a02b361.avif?t=1767843596\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras_big/a937897f49cf64d29b36fb728a02b361.webp?t=1767843596 width=1560 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras/a8b2514e01b3dfd405b38216f98663cd.poster.avif?t=1767843596\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras/a8b2514e01b3dfd405b38216f98663cd.webm?t=1767843596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras/a8b2514e01b3dfd405b38216f98663cd.mp4?t=1767843596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distant Isles is a party-based, turn-based roguelike and role-playing game</strong>. Building a reliable and loyal party, you will explore procedurally-generated islands, seeking out adventure, finding hidden shrines and fighting all manner of creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, be careful not to run out of resilience or gain injuries - your adventure can rapidly descend into chaos and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each island contains a wealth of secrets, treasures and dangers. Shrines contain valuable treasures, but will also set off dangerous traps - hopefully your party can out run fire. Caves can lead you across the island or contain monsters; lookouts can show you new locations (just be careful not to fall down and break a bone!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras/fd45c21cc801560161de1760c3c85fc6.avif?t=1767843596\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras_big/fd45c21cc801560161de1760c3c85fc6.webp?t=1767843596 width=1560 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras/3021103b399f2a764b8dc102c3e81b06.poster.avif?t=1767843596\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras/3021103b399f2a764b8dc102c3e81b06.webm?t=1767843596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras/3021103b399f2a764b8dc102c3e81b06.mp4?t=1767843596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather a party of up to four adventurers and venture forth!</strong> Each party member has their own unique set of traits and quirks, allowing them to navigate dangerous situations (and be a burden in others). Find or purchase skill books to train and customise each party member, allowing you to build your perfect crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each party member can equip three items - a weapon, clothing and a trinket - allowing for even more customisation and specialisation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras/bc9d172f9412354069b4e6238d56ca05.avif?t=1767843596\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras_big/bc9d172f9412354069b4e6238d56ca05.webp?t=1767843596 width=1560 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To ensure your survival, you'll need to forage, hunt, trade and seek out treasure to maintain your resilience.</strong> Resilience represents your party's ability to keep travelling and exploring. Each step uses resilience, and traversing extreme or rough terrain will use more. Eating foods and resting will increase your resilience, allowing you to travel deeper into each island. However, make sure not to run out of resilience - disease could set in and bad events may happen.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras/a937897f49cf64d29b36fb728a02b361.avif?t=1767843596\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras_big/a937897f49cf64d29b36fb728a02b361.webp?t=1767843596 width=1560 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras/a8b2514e01b3dfd405b38216f98663cd.poster.avif?t=1767843596\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras/a8b2514e01b3dfd405b38216f98663cd.webm?t=1767843596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras/a8b2514e01b3dfd405b38216f98663cd.mp4?t=1767843596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distant Isles is a party-based, turn-based roguelike and role-playing game</strong>. Building a reliable and loyal party, you will explore procedurally-generated islands, seeking out adventure, finding hidden shrines and fighting all manner of creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, be careful not to run out of resilience or gain injuries - your adventure can rapidly descend into chaos and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each island contains a wealth of secrets, treasures and dangers. Shrines contain valuable treasures, but will also set off dangerous traps - hopefully your party can out run fire. Caves can lead you across the island or contain monsters; lookouts can show you new locations (just be careful not to fall down and break a bone!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras/fd45c21cc801560161de1760c3c85fc6.avif?t=1767843596\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras_big/fd45c21cc801560161de1760c3c85fc6.webp?t=1767843596 width=1560 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras/3021103b399f2a764b8dc102c3e81b06.poster.avif?t=1767843596\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras/3021103b399f2a764b8dc102c3e81b06.webm?t=1767843596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras/3021103b399f2a764b8dc102c3e81b06.mp4?t=1767843596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather a party of up to four adventurers and venture forth!</strong> Each party member has their own unique set of traits and quirks, allowing them to navigate dangerous situations (and be a burden in others). Find or purchase skill books to train and customise each party member, allowing you to build your perfect crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each party member can equip three items - a weapon, clothing and a trinket - allowing for even more customisation and specialisation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras/bc9d172f9412354069b4e6238d56ca05.avif?t=1767843596\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/extras_big/bc9d172f9412354069b4e6238d56ca05.webp?t=1767843596 width=1560 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To ensure your survival, you'll need to forage, hunt, trade and seek out treasure to maintain your resilience.</strong> Resilience represents your party's ability to keep travelling and exploring. Each step uses resilience, and traversing extreme or rough terrain will use more. Eating foods and resting will increase your resilience, allowing you to travel deeper into each island. However, make sure not to run out of resilience - disease could set in and bad events may happen.</p>", "short_description": "Sail the seas, captain your crew and seek out treasure and adventure! A turn-based roguelike and role-playing game, in Distant Isles you will explore procedural islands, find treasure, and fight all manner of creatures. Make sure you manage your resources wisely - danger awaits at every turn.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/eabba23280d2ef6879d17df3429d0799f29da1be/header.jpg?t=1767843596", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/87ae523e51efedd9fda317973ff6db6ed067c884/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767843596", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908130/87ae523e51efedd9fda317973ff6db6ed067c884/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767843596", "website": "https://twitter.com/WorldFormDev", 